    {"target":"Strings/UI","key":"Character_FarmStandard","source":"Standard Farm_A simple plot of land, with a large amount of open space to design your farm.","translation":"標準農場_一片簡單的土地，擁有大片開放空間，可供你設計農場。"},
    {"target":"Strings/UI","key":"Character_FarmForaging","source":"Forest Farm_The woods limit your farming space. However, the bounty of the forest is nearly at your doorstep...","translation":"森林農場_樹林限制了耕作空間。不過，豐富的森林資源幾乎就在家門口……"},
    {"target":"Strings/UI","key":"Character_FarmFishing","source":"Riverland Farm_Your farm is spread across several islands and scenic riverbanks. Fish are more common here than usual. You start with a fish smoker.","translation":"河畔農場_農場分布在數座島嶼與風景優美的河岸上。這裡的魚比其他地方更常見。開局時擁有一台燻魚機。"},
    {"target":"Strings/UI","key":"Character_FarmMining","source":"Hill-top Farm_Rocky terrain and a winding river make it difficult to design your farm. However, a mineral deposit provides mining opportunities.","translation":"山頂農場_崎嶇地形與蜿蜒河流讓農場難以規劃。不過，一處礦床提供了採礦機會。"},
    {"target":"Strings/UI","key":"Character_FarmCombat","source":"Wilderness Farm_There's plenty of good land here, but beware... at night the monsters come out.","translation":"荒野農場_這裡有大量優良土地，但要小心……夜晚會有怪物出沒。"},
    {"target":"Strings/UI","key":"Character_FarmFourCorners","source":"Four Corners Farm_The land is divided into four parcels, each with its own perk. Perfect for a group!","translation":"四角農場_土地分成四個區塊，各自擁有不同優勢。非常適合團隊！"},
